      By using the App, you agree to the collection and use of your information as described in the Privacy Policy.
    </p>
    <p>Privacy Policy URL:<br /><a href="/privacy">https://particlesofmind.com/privacy</a></p>
    <p>Terms &amp; Conditions URL:<br /><a href="/terms">https://particlesofmind.com/terms</a></p>
    <p>Key data practices include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Account data and profile information are stored on our servers via Supabase.</li>
      <li>Location data is used solely for habit verification and is not sold to third parties.</li>
      <li>Pose detection data is processed on-device and is not stored on our servers in raw form.</li>
      <li>
        Arete conversations may be processed by third-party AI providers and retained according to our Privacy Policy
        and provider terms.
      </li>
      <li>We do not sell your personal data to advertisers.</li>
    </ul>

