      the App and do not constitute any form of certification, credential, or official assessment.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>9.2 No Guarantees.</strong> We make no guarantees regarding the outcomes of using Paths, including but not
      limited to improvements in health, fitness, skill, or any other area of personal development.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>9.3 Score Integrity.</strong> Any attempt to manipulate, falsify, or artificially inflate your PATH score
      or habit completion records is a violation of these Terms and may result in account suspension or termination.
    </p>

